      "content": "thanks. i'm just a bit worried because it feels way more intense than usual, like it literally hit me like a clap of thunder. but i really dont want to go to the er if i can avoid it, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. you think it's definitely just the migraine? maybe i should just double the dose of the sumatriptan to make sure it kicks in?",
