    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but i've really had these before and usually a bigger dose just helps me sleep it off. plus i've got some naproxen in the cabinet too, would it be okay if i take that along with the sumatriptan? i just really want to get this under control so i can lie down. it's just a headache, right?",
